    "description": {
      "value": "You assert your power over the target's own spirit as you reach deep into its soul in order to discover a moment of excruciating anguish, debilitating humiliation, or abject despair. The target takes 12d8 spirit damage and must attempt a Will save.\n\nCritical Success: The target takes no damage, with a brief sensation of pain followed by a pleasant memory.\nSuccess: The target takes half damage and is frightened 1.\nFailure: The target takes full damage and is frightened 2.\nCritical Failure: The target takes double damage and is frightened 2 and off-guard for 1 round."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d8."
    },
